Nautilo lattice-crypto OpenMLS WASM wrapper

This package includes source derived from OpenMLS openmls-wasm and a compiled
WASM artifact built from the Cargo dependency resolution in
openmls-wasm/Cargo.lock.

OpenMLS source baseline:
  tag: openmls-v0.8.1
  commit: 47dbedecad0c1fd8eb5368d582250ebfcc1e1ce6
  repository: https://github.com/openmls/openmls
  license: MIT

The wrapper was modified by the lattice-lab and Nautilo projects. The original
lattice-lab license is preserved in LICENSE.lattice-lab. OpenMLS's license is
preserved in openmls-wasm/LICENSE.

The compiled dependency closure includes MPL-2.0 software from the hpke-rs
project. Source and license information, dependency inventory, and security
advisory dispositions are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md,
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.cargo.md, and openmls-wasm/ADVISORIES.md.
